ound on, and ramps for you to fly off of. Or take a more leisurely approach and enjoy the relaxing scenery the island has to offer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775970/extras/7cf7372c9f0669878bc8ffb0bdb76c24.poster.avif?t=1705009803\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775970/extras/7cf7372c9f0669878bc8ffb0bdb76c24.webm?t=1705009803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775970/extras/7cf7372c9f0669878bc8ffb0bdb76c24.mp4?t=1705009803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
